==Strategy==
Elephantidae Papaou is a slow pushing wall that is immune to any form of crowd-control and has only one knockback. This stage centers around sending a consistent stream of meatshields while dealing with different peons.

The [[Battle Items#Sniper the Cat|Sniper the Cat]] item can still be used to push back Elephantidae Papaou.

Bring Legend Units with at least 420 range like [[Urs & Fenrir (Special Cat)|Urs & Minka]]/[[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Awakened Ururun]] and [[Ancient Egg: N001 (Special Cat)|Haniwa Cat]] + two meatshields. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] can be used to handle the Ragin' Gories. [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] and [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] can help with the opening of the stage. A specialist that is either [[Immune to Weaken]] or has high range or pierce is recommended for Great Angel Chibinel. Courier Cat can also be used to chip Elephantidae.

Luring the second Ragin' Gory and killing it before Great Angel Chibinel spawns is very helpful, and prevents being overun later in the stage.

